<title>USA: ACCO World unit extends tender for Advanced Gravis.</title>
<headline>ACCO World unit extends tender for Advanced Gravis.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACCO World Corp, a unit of American Brands Inc, said Tuesday that its British Columbia subsidiary extended a cash tender offer for Advanced Gravis Computer Technology Ltd another 10 days to September 20.</p>
<p>About 59 percent of Advanced Gravis shares have been tendered to date, said ACCO World president Norman Wesley.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
